-align:left;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;宮川　潤一&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
