&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(３) 繰延税金資産および繰延税金負債の変動の内訳&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;繰延税金資産および繰延税金負債の変動の内訳は、以下の通りです。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;に終了した１年間&lt;/p&gt;
