  <jpigp_cor:NotesEarningsPerShareConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;41. １株当たり利益&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;基本的１株当たり純利益および希薄化後１株当たり純利益は、以下の通りです。&lt;/p&gt;
